<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, NOV 22.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, NOV 22.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Nov 22	Nov 21	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  236.900     236.460     237.040   -0.06 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  303.360     303.390     303.640   -0.09 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.820     157.825     165.490   -4.63 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.534	46.634	48.410   -3.88 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  399.040     398.140     366.280    8.94 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.695     140.675     147.886   -4.86 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.829	15.804	14.975    5.70 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  212.940     211.840     230.135   -7.47 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.877	 1.880	 1.939   -3.20 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.561	 1.563	 1.575   -0.89 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  186.715     186.975     206.030   -9.37 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
